### 4.2 模式与布局切换

```typescript
// editorStore 扩展
type EditorMode = 'furniture' | 'floorPlan'; // 已有

interface PlatformDesignMode {
  active: true;
  roomId: string;
  /** 进入编辑时的材质快照，用于关闭/清空 */
  snapshotPresetId: string;
  /** 编辑中的材质 presetId */
  draftPresetId: string;
  activePresetId: string | null;
  canvasView: CanvasViewState;  // 复用 lib/floorPlan/canvasView.ts
}

interface EditorState {
  platformDesignMode: PlatformDesignMode | null;
  enterPlatformDesignMode: (roomId: string) => void;
  exitPlatformDesignMode: (opts?: { save?: boolean }) => void;
  setActiveFloorMaterialPreset: (presetId: string | null) => void;
  setPlatformCanvasView: (view: Partial<CanvasViewState>) => void;
}
```

`EditorLayout` 渲染优先级：

```
materialMode?.active     → MaterialEditorLayout
platformDesignMode?.active → PlatformDesignLayout
else                     → 原有摆家具 / 画户型布局
```

### 4.3 数据流

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  RoomFloorPickLayer -->|select room| sceneStore
  PlatformDesignButton -->|enter| editorStore
  PlatformMaterialPanel -->|setActivePreset| editorStore
  PlatformDesignCanvas -->|set material| platformHistory
  platformHistory -->|update draftPresetId| editorStore
  PlatformPreviewViewport -->|read draftPresetId| editorStore
  PlatformDesignTopBar -->|save| sceneStore
  sceneStore -->|persist| IndexedDB
  RoomFloorMeshLayer -->|read saved presetId| sceneStore
```

**原则**：

- **编辑会话内**：换材操作只改 `draftPresetId`，不直接改 `document`
- **保存**：一次性将 `draftPresetId` 写入 `floorPlan.rooms[roomId].floorMaterial`
- **关闭**：丢弃 draft，不影响 document

